OL,3,GNEWSACouncil rejects proposed free
OL,4,Acommunity skips
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has rejected calls to install
OL,7,Fcommunity skips in an effort to tackle
OL,8,Ffly-tipping and help clear a waste
OL,9,Fbacklog.
OL,11,FThe proposal was put to Sunderland city
OL,12,Fcouncillors by opposition Liberal
OL,13,FDemocrat councillors, but it was voted
OL,14,Fdown at a full council meeting of the
OL,15,FReform UK-led authority.
OL,17,FSkips would have been put in Deptford
OL,18,Fand Hendon, Pallion and Ford and
OL,19,FWashington Central wards as part of the
OL,20,Fproposal, with a hope to expand it
OL,21,Facross all areas of the city.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
