OL,3,GNEWSACouncil rejects proposed free
OL,4,Acommunity skips
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the idea was
OL,7,F"laudable", and would "create a new,
OL,8,Frecurring revenue commitment at a time
OL,9,Fof significant financial pressure".
